# Bass track (narrow stereo): "string bass" and "octave bass" lines from C1 to C3 with a bend.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 1.0
track bass
preset 40 60 6 80 220 40 0 0 128 0 128 205 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C1 2 127
note 2 C2 2 110
note 4 G1 2 127
note 6 Bb1 2 90
param p1 255 8
param p2 40 8
note 8 C2 4 127
bend 10 -200
bend 12 0
note 12 F2 2 127
note 14 C3 2 60
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 30
expect peak_below -8
